<title>USA: U.S. to sell $19.25 bln of 52-wk bills Dec 5.</title>
<headline>U.S. to sell $19.25 bln of 52-wk bills Dec 5.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Treasury said it will auction $19.25 billion of 52-week bills on Dec 5 to raise $450 million as $18.792 billion of 52-week bills are maturing.</p>
<p>The bills will be issued Dec 12 and mature Dec 11, 1997.</p>
<p>The CUSIP number for the bills will be 9127942X1.</p>
</text>
